msgid "\\nThe test email never arrived\\n"
msgstr "\\n测试电子邮件从未到达\\n"

msgid "\\nYour WordPress site cannot send emails reliably. This is a very common hosting issue — the default PHP mail function is often blocked or ends up in spam. Installing an SMTP plugin routes your emails through a verified mail service and fixes this in minutes.\\n"
msgstr "\\n您的 WordPress 网站无法可靠地发送电子邮件。这是一个非常常见的托管问题——默认的 PHP 邮件功能经常被阻止或最终成为垃圾邮件。安装 SMTP 插件可通过经过验证的邮件服务路由您的电子邮件,并在几分钟内修复此问题。\\n"

msgid "\\nWordPress sent the email - it just never arrived\\n"
msgstr "\\nWordPress 发送了电子邮件 - 但它从未到达\\n"

msgid "\\nYour site handed the message to your mail server successfully, so WordPress and this plugin did their part. It was lost, delayed or rejected afterwards - most often the receiving mailbox filed it as spam, or your host never delivered it from the outbound queue. Sending through an SMTP service, with SPF and DKIM records for your domain, is what fixes this.\\n"
msgstr "\\n您的站点已成功将消息传递给您的邮件服务器,因此 WordPress 和此插件发挥了作用。随后邮件丢失、延迟或被拒绝 - 最常见的是接收邮箱将其归档为垃圾邮件,或者您的主机从未将其从出站队列中传递。通过 SMTP 服务发送,并使用您的域的 SPF 和 DKIM 记录,可以解决此问题。\\n"

msgid "\\nWordPress could not send the email\\n"
msgstr "\\nWordPress 无法发送电子邮件\\n"

msgid "\\nThe message never left your website: WordPress returned an error while sending it. Install and configure an SMTP plugin, or ask your host whether PHP mail is disabled.\\n"
msgstr "\\n消息从未离开您的网站:WordPress 在发送消息时返回错误。安装并配置 SMTP 插件,或询问您的主机是否禁用 PHP 邮件。\\n"

msgid "\\nYour emails arrive, but will most likely land in spam\\n"
msgstr "\\n您的电子邮件已到达,但很可能会落入垃圾邮件\\n"

msgid "[['Delivery itself works - the test message reached us. What is missing is trust: sending through an SMTP service and adding SPF and DKIM records for your domain is what moves your emails from the spam folder to the inbox.\\n"
msgstr "[['交付本身有效 - 测试消息已到达我们。缺少的是信任:通过 SMTP 服务发送并为您的域添加 SPF 和 DKIM 记录,才能将您的电子邮件从垃圾邮件文件夹移至收件箱。\\n"

msgid "\\nThe test email was delivered with a deliverability score of%1$sout of 100. Under%2$s, most mailboxes file messages in the spam folder, so the people filling in your forms may never see them.\\n"
msgstr "\\n测试电子邮件的送达率分数为%1$s(满分 100)。在%2$s下,大多数邮箱将邮件归档到垃圾邮件文件夹中,因此填写表单的人可能永远不会看到它们。\\n"

