msgid "\\nHelp & Setup Guide\\n"
msgstr "\\n帮助和设置指南\\n"

msgid "\\nEverything you need to connect forms to Google Sheets\\n"
msgstr "\\n将表单连接到 Google 表格所需的一切\\n"

msgid "\\nStep-by-Step Setup\\n"
msgstr "\\n分步设置\\n"

msgid "\\nCreate or Select a Project\\n"
msgstr "\\n创建或选择项目\\n"

msgid "\\nOpen console.cloud.google.com and log in → click the Project dropdown (top-left) → New Project (or pick an existing one) → enter a name → Create', 'en']]"
msgstr "\\n打开 console.cloud.google.com 并登录 → 单击项目下拉菜单(左上角)→ 新建项目(或选择现有项目)→ 输入名称 → 创建', 'en']]"

msgid "\\nEnable both Google APIs\\n"
msgstr "\\n启用两个 Google API\\n"

msgid "\\nAPIs & Services → Library → enable<strong>Google Sheets API</strong>and<strong>Google Drive API</strong>(both are required — Drive lists and creates the files)\\n"
msgstr "\\nAPI 和服务 → 库 → 启用<strong>Google Sheets API</strong>和<strong>Google Drive API</strong>(两者都是必需的 - 云端硬盘列出并创建文件)\\n"

msgid "\\nCreate a Service Account\\n"
msgstr "\\n创建服务帐户\\n"

msgid "\\nAPIs & Services → Credentials → Create Credentials → Service Account → enter a name → Done\\n"
msgstr "\\nAPI 和服务 → 凭据 → 创建凭据 → 服务帐户 → 输入名称 → 完成\\n"

msgid "\\nCreate a JSON Key\\n"
msgstr "\\n创建 JSON 密钥\\n"

msgid "\\nOpen the service account → Keys tab → Add Key → Create New Key → choose JSON (file downloads automatically)\\n"
msgstr "\\n打开服务帐户 → 密钥选项卡 → 添加密钥 → 创建新密钥 → 选择 JSON(文件自动下载)\\n"

msgid "\\nDrop the Key File\\n"
msgstr "\\n删除密钥文件\\n"

msgid "\\nDrag the downloaded file into the Connections tab — it is verified automatically and you’ll see a green “Connected” badge\\n"
msgstr "\\n将下载的文件拖到“连接”选项卡中 - 它会自动验证,您将看到一个绿色的“已连接”徽章\\n"

msgid "\\nAdd Your Google Email\\n"
msgstr "\\n添加您的 Google 电子邮件\\n"

msgid "\\nOn the Connections tab, fill in “Your Google email” and Save — sheets the plugin creates are then shared to you so they appear in your own Drive\\n"
msgstr "\\n在“连接”选项卡上,填写“您的 Google 电子邮件”并保存 - 然后将插件创建的工作表共享给您,以便它们出现在您自己的云端硬盘中\\n"

msgid "\\nBind a Form (create a sheet)\\n"
msgstr "\\n绑定表单(创建工作表)\\n"

msgid "\\nForm Bindings → pick a form →<strong>Create New Sheet</strong>→ Save. No manual sharing needed — this is the easiest path\\n"
msgstr "\\n表单绑定 → 选择一个表单 →<strong>创建新工作表</strong>→ 保存。无需手动共享 - 这是最简单的路径\\n"

msgid "\\n...or use an existing sheet\\n"
msgstr "\\n...或使用现有工作表\\n"

msgid "\\nPrefer your own sheet? Open it → Share → paste the service account email (copy button on its card) → Editor → then Browse My Sheets in the wizard\", 'en']]"
msgstr "\\n更喜欢您自己的工作表?打开它→共享→粘贴服务帐户电子邮件(其卡上的复制按钮)→编辑器→然后在向导中浏览我的工作表\", 'en']]"

msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题解答"

msgid "\\nI created a sheet — where did it go?\\n"
msgstr "\\n我创建了一个工作表 - 它去了哪里?\\n"

msgid "\\nService accounts create files in their own hidden Drive. Add “Your Google email” on the Connections tab and the plugin shares every new sheet to you automatically — it then appears under “Shared with me” in your Google Drive. Each sheet also has an “Open” link right in this dashboard.\\n"
msgstr "\\n服务帐户在其自己的隐藏云端硬盘中创建文件。在“连接”选项卡上添加“您的 Google 电子邮件”,该插件会自动向您共享每个新工作表 - 然后它会显示在您的 Google 云端硬盘中的“与我共享”下。每个工作表在此仪表板中还有一个“打开”链接。\\n"

msgid "\\nWhy don’t I see my existing sheet in the picker?\\n"
msgstr "\\n为什么我在选取器中看不到现有工作表?\\n"

msgid "\\nIt must be shared with the service account’s email first: open the sheet → Share → paste the email (use the copy button on the connection card) → set Editor → Share. Then click “Browse My Sheets” again.\\n"
msgstr "\\nIt must be shared with the service account’s email first: open the sheet → Share → paste the email (use the copy button on the connection card) → set Editor → Share.然后再次单击“浏览我的工作表”。\\n"

msgid "\\nTest result: Google API is not enabled.\\n"
msgstr "\\n测试结果:Google API 未启用。\\n"

msgid "\\nOpen Google Cloud Console for the same project → APIs & Services → Library, and enable BOTH “Google Sheets API” and “Google Drive API”. Wait a minute, then retest.\\n"
msgstr "\\n为同一项目打开 Google Cloud Console → API 和服务 → 库,并启用“Google Sheets API”和“Google Drive API”。稍等片刻,然后重新测试。\\n"

msgid "\\nTest result: Access/Permission denied\\n"
msgstr "\\n测试结果:访问/权限被拒绝\\n"

msgid "\\nThe service account can authenticate but can’t reach that specific spreadsheet. Re-share the sheet with the service account email as Editor, or create a new sheet instead.\\n"
msgstr "\\n服务帐户可以进行身份验证,但无法访问该特定电子表格。与作为编辑者的服务帐户电子邮件重新共享工作表,或创建一个新工作表。\\n"

msgid "\\nOpenSSL is required.\\n"
msgstr "\\n需要 OpenSSL。\\n"

msgid "\\nThe server is missing the PHP OpenSSL extension used to sign the secure Google request. Ask your host to enable it — no plugin setting can replace it.\\n"
msgstr "\\nThe server is missing the PHP OpenSSL extension used to sign the secure Google request.请您的主机启用它 - 没有任何插件设置可以替代它。\\n"

msgid "\\nCan I connect more than one service account?\\n"
msgstr "\\n我可以连接多个服务帐户吗?\\n"

msgid "\\nYes — drop as many JSON keys as you like in the Connections tab and pick which one each form binding should use.\\n"
msgstr "\\n是 - 在“连接”选项卡中放置任意数量的 JSON 键,然后选择每个表单绑定应使用的键。\\n"

msgid "[['Does the connection expire?\\n"
msgstr "[['连接是否过期?\\n"

msgid "\\nNo. The integration runs entirely on the server using your JSON key — there’s no browser session or login to expire.\\n"
msgstr "\\n不。集成完全使用您的 JSON 密钥在服务器上运行 - 没有浏览器会话或登录会过期。\\n"

msgid "\\nCan I choose which field goes to which column?\\n"
msgstr "\\n我可以选择哪个字段进入哪一列吗?\\n"

msgid "\\nYes. In the binding wizard’s<strong>Columns & Fields</strong>step, drag rows (or use ▲▼) to set the order, rename each column header, and toggle any field off to skip it. The A/B/C badge shows exactly where each field lands.\\n"
msgstr "\\n是的。在绑定向导的<strong>列和字段</strong>步骤中,拖动行(或使用 ▲▼)设置顺序,重命名每个列标题,然后关闭任何字段以跳过它。 A/B/C 徽章准确显示每个字段的着陆位置。\\n"

msgid "\\nCan I style the sheet automatically?\\n"
msgstr "\\n我可以自动设置工作表的样式吗?\\n"

msgid "\\nYes. The<strong>Style & Save</strong>step offers Google-Sheets themes (colored header, frozen top row, alternating row colors). Pick one and it’s applied on the first sync, or click “Apply style now”.\\n"
msgstr "\\n是的。<strong>样式和保存</strong>步骤提供 Google-Sheets 主题(彩色标题、冻结顶行、交替行颜色)。选择一个并在第一次同步时应用它,或单击“立即应用样式”。\\n"

msgid "\\nWhat if my form fields change later?\\n"
msgstr "\\n如果我的表单字段稍后更改怎么办?\\n"

msgid "\\nNew fields are added automatically. In mapped mode, open the Columns step and click “Refresh fields from form” to pull them into the mapping; in “All Form Fields” mode they appear as new columns on the next submission.\\n"
msgstr "\\n自动添加新字段。在映射模式下,打开“列”步骤,然后单击“从表单中刷新字段”将其拉入映射中;在“所有表单字段”模式下,它们在下次提交时显示为新列。\\n"

msgid "\\nWhat if the tab doesn’t exist yet?\\n"
msgstr "\\n如果该选项卡尚不存在怎么办?\\n"

msgid "\\nIt is created automatically the first time a submission is synced.\\n"
msgstr "\\n它是在第一次同步提交时自动创建的。\\n"

