msgstr "\\n您的服务器没有设置 SMTP 主机或 sendmail 路径。电子邮件可能无法送达。\\n"

msgid "\\nTest email could not be sent.\\n"
msgstr "\\n无法发送测试电子邮件。\\n"

msgid "\\nIt seems that your WordPress site could not send a test email. To manually test your email system, go to Flux Forms > Settings > Email Settings tab and click the \"Check Email Server\" button.\\n"
msgstr "\\n您的 WordPress 网站似乎无法发送测试电子邮件。要手动测试您的电子邮件系统,请转到 Flux Forms > 设置 > 电子邮件设置选项卡,然后单击“检查电子邮件服务器”按钮。\\n"

msgid "\\nInvalid email address.\\n"
msgstr "\\n电子邮件地址无效。\\n"

